Debug mode highlights a YAML file's header comment (here its first comment, so not the key's) and each top-level key, not values or nested keys.
Expected output is hand-written: the TypeScript build has no data file support.
== args
--debug
input/a.yaml
== file input/a.yaml
# The key.
key: value
list:
  - nested: 1
== stdout
\x1b[32m# The key.\x1b[0m
\x1b[32mkey\x1b[0m: value
\x1b[32mlist\x1b[0m:
  - nested: 1
== stderr
== exit 0
